       - _parse_gt_payload: safe JSON envelope parser (None if not v1 format)
       - _run_group_calls: shared async runner — groups indices by gt string,
         fires ALL groups concurrently via single asyncio.gather (PLAN C.4
         fire-all-gather), scatters back to original positions
       - svg_judge_group_scores + svg_solve_aux_scores: batch-level adapters
         with graceful degrade to [0]*n on any exception
    
    3. nemo_rl/environments/vlm_environment.py
       - VLMVerifyWorker.__init__ now separates per-sample pairs from batch pairs
       - verify() does per-sample loop first, then one call per batch reward
